# Android Project Standards

- Kotlin only; Jetpack Compose + Material 3 (no XML layouts or View system UI)
- Package layout: `data/` (api, model, repository), `ui/` (screens, navigation, theme)
- Naming: `*Screen`, `*ViewModel`, `*Repository`, `*ApiService`
- Keep composables stateless; hold state in ViewModels via `StateFlow` and `collectAsStateWithLifecycle`
- Reuse the existing theme under `ui/theme/`
